from the docs, i find it fairly clear to write in the `opencode.jsonc`

```jsonc
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "lsp": {
    "pyright": {
      "disabled": true
    },
    "ty": {
      "command": [
        "uv run --with ty ty server",
      ],
      "extensions": [
        ".py",
        ".pyi"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

